msgstr "재학증명서(최신)"

#: .\guides\templates\guides\guide_arc_foreign.html:215
msgid "由學校 OIA 出具，證明居留事由（就學）仍持續存在。"
msgstr "학교 OIA 발급. 거류 사유(취학)가 여전히 유효함을 증명."

#: .\guides\templates\guides\guide_arc_foreign.html:223
#: .\guides\templates\guides\guide_arc_foreign.html:283
#: .\guides\templates\guides\guide_arc_foreign.html:351
